    }

    // Target items = [nameString, suffix marker...] -> reference descriptor.
    // Walks a target path (members and calls) up to the last element, which must
    // be a member. Returns {b, obj, key} with the object and the last key evaluated.
    // A target reference is {name, path} for the ordinary 'a.b[i]' form and {base, path}
    // when the path hangs off an arbitrary expression instead of a name ('[1].a = 2',
    // '(a ** b).c = 1'). retarget re-roots a parenthesized target and appends whatever
    // suffixes follow the ')', so '(a).b' is the very same reference as 'a.b'.
